$il$SIXTH INSTANCE, Alexander Peretti at 0815, P595, Austria. PREVIOUS DRAFTS 1 again, six out of six. Counters 60 and 17 become 50 and 20 with Rejected 21 to 28, so ten left Pending Review against three approved and seven rejected: still balanced, still nothing lost. The correlation is as proven as it can get from the outside now, and the only remaining question is the one in the comment above, which needs one approval on an unrevised draft to answer.$il$
